# Base URL of the backend API (no trailing slash). Optional in development:
#  - on a phone (Expo Go / dev build) it defaults to the machine running Metro, port 8000
#  - on web dev it defaults to http://localhost:8000
#  - in the production web build (docker) it defaults to "" (same origin, via the nginx gateway)
# Set it only to point at a different host, e.g. the EC2 public DNS.
EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL=
